      "kind": "scored",
      "mark": "Partial",
      "value": 1,
      "quote": "The City has a responsibility to keep sidewalks clear and safe for people walking and people using wheelchairs and mobility devices.\" \"Having tents and tarps blocking sidewalks is unsafe.\" Commits × Neither: possessions-storage and sidewalk-clear, not named-space reclaim or night lighting. 📋 Record, matching capacity-first, not a miss: he voted against the 4 Jul 2024 Irving / Vic West overnight-sheltering prohibition because \"we \\[do not\\] have adequate sheltering and housing capacity\" (https://davethompsonvictoria.ca/whack-a-mole-is-not-a-solution-to-homelessness/",
      "why": "9 Jul 2025 restatement of the 4 Jul 2024 vote). FLAG toward Close 2.0 if Joa reads sidewalk-clear as comparable to M34–M37.",
